      "explanation": "Official JAMB 2011 English Language Question 8 (Comprehension — Implied Meaning). Syllabus objective: deduce or infer the writers’ intentions including mood, attitude to the subject matter and opinion Verified answer: Option D (treasure and ruminate on them).",
      "explanation_short": "Correct Option: D (treasure and ruminate on them) · Topic: Comprehension (Implied Meaning).",
      "explanation_pidgin": "For dis JAMB 2011 English Language question under Comprehension (Implied Meaning), the correct answer na Option D (treasure and ruminate on them)."
