pted from Onosode, GO: 'The politics of Managing People, Prospects and Poverty: The Role of the University, 1990 OAU Convocation}] The writer advocates for multiple sources of university funding in order to ______",
      "options": {
        "A": "enhance university autonomy",
        "B": "reduce dependence on the government",
        "C": "ensure that the numerous needs of the universities are met",
        "D": "maintain acceptable levels of infrastructural development"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Official JAMB 2020 English Language Question 7 (Comprehension — Synthesis Of Ideas). Syllabus objective: deduce or infer the writers’ intentions including mood, attitude to the subject matter and opinion Verified answer: Option A (enhance university autonomy).",
