      "options": {
        "A": "Change is inevitable",
        "B": "Change is inimitable",
        "C": "Change is inestimable",
        "D": "Change is invaluable"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Official JAMB 2014 English Language Question 66 (Core Syllabus — UTME Objective). Syllabus objective: Master Core Syllabus (UTME Objective) under JAMB UTME conditions. Verified answer: Option A (Change is inevitable).",
