      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Official JAMB 2021 English Language Question 10 (Core Syllabus — UTME Objective). Syllabus objective: Master Core Syllabus (UTME Objective) under JAMB UTME conditions. Verified answer: Option B (extreme).",
